am/apps/1938300/extras/14f803e9a2a1186172186e065053e05f.webm?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/14f803e9a2a1186172186e065053e05f.mp4?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>corruption your prisoner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/645b80bf4bab339fa996ae789c26adf4.poster.avif?t=1744941992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/645b80bf4bab339fa996ae789c26adf4.webm?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/645b80bf4bab339fa996ae789c26adf4.mp4?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Fight and capture them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/5eb74c36373f685f7c2893ade9925826.poster.avif?t=1744941992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/5eb74c36373f685f7c2893ade9925826.webm?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938300/extras/5eb74c36373f685f7c2893ade9925826.mp4?t=1744941992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>corruption the Queen into your defense building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Gameplay -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Management + Sidescroller </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the forces of evil and corrupt the entire world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack settlements, capture female prisoners, and use them to expand your lair~\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your prisoners to infiltrate the humans and leave them utterly defenseless~\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Sexy Time -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uses Spine's paper doll animation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Simulation -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use slaves, build seedbeds and gain resources to expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the tech tree to unlock Tentacle / Slime / Plant / Insect / Demon  seedbeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Combat -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control tentacles or slaves. Upgrade your characters to become even more powerful and lead them to conquer new maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Infiltration -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are your enemies too powerful? Send your well-trained prisoners to infiltrate them and lower their defenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------- Tech Tree -----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five tech trees available for upgrade: Tentacles / Slime / Plants / Insects / Demons</p><br>* French/Russian/Spanish localization of store page descriptions and in-game text, provided by developers and fans",
